FlClash Web adaptation provenance

The Dart compatibility templates under overlay/, the original browser helper
functions and Web assets, and the import-rewrite/font/hook definitions in
adaptations.py are derived from:

  FlClash-web by libzonda and contributors
  https://github.com/libzonda/FlClash-web
  revision a36e2d8185119102c2cc2f563a062ca9b322b249

The source project's GNU General Public License version 3 is retained verbatim
as LICENSE.FlClash-web beside this notice. FlClash itself and its application
icons retain their existing upstream attribution and repository LICENSE.

The staging/build implementation and authentication integration were adapted
for this repository's v0.9.3 application and protocol. No upstream Git checkout,
submodule deletion, in-place apply/revert, controller-address widening, or
generated-code edits from the source build scripts are retained.

web/sqlite3.wasm is the sqlite3.dart 3.7.0 WebAssembly release asset, copied
unchanged from the source overlay:
  https://github.com/simolus3/sqlite3.dart/releases/download/sqlite3-3.7.0/sqlite3.wasm
  SHA-256: fbcd2e8214f9231ea961e1b7706a22dd1194cfbfe6f26f13841b5aa7a0be1a1f
SQLite is in the public domain (https://sqlite.org/copyright.html).
The sqlite3.dart Dart package is MIT-licensed; its dependency license remains
in the package and in Flutter's generated third-party notices.
